UAyl13-qYyh9w&oe=6AFF03A9"}, {"file_name": "Cinema mode.png", "id": "1235714004183096", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391713_1235714007516429_6995113886859378751_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nDKBENcKTLcQ7kNvwGPBNHT&_nc_oc=AdoZIZSwH2BoQWeUXasxToapS_xIwcr2bDBjq853Sks5PL-cXayfLGS4nIu9cdrCQJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQL1ZCDfTedHC0OEaVi-hbjjzo7NImVqu8Z0WNc-edRJg&oe=6AFF2441"}, {"file_name": "Multitasking.png", "id": "578980975009283", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391776_578980978342616_2628125508637055265_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GZ_d6Dn6CBoQ7kNvwGbjssZ&_nc_oc=Adp0q_yMHzmb9bPPe1sIZO5Zq-kX27fQdptbKXXP2d_5bQ0cEDdMWoKfnPU5fOsFadY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRIt0tq0DiAhn13XvpcuE3YQC8aW5aEPUGVyOmDtVGYtA&oe=6AFF0053"}, {"file_name": "Environments.png", "id": "959572546166189", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391845_959572549499522_1912975437178358874_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Klf-p08mTAIQ7kNvwGnw_xO&_nc_oc=Adp7WJwfHGzCFDkiAQdrPF02SKJ_4ideukqfTeW9BtW18Zcj-JMTQEUt4_pRDyqhtbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYRBlH7VWX2kHdTnfUIruhH-Swv6lvGccWaV4ofkvukw&oe=6AFF25C4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover.png", "id": "1235182248245326", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499328676_1235182251578659_179686033054008922_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kf5hTWsktWoQ7kNvwHsSmHf&_nc_oc=AdpBpq1C9xzfpszoRa20XBT5SdDj5SouEugSl4aVewqMKo2G-8ZJkTVKWJD84Md5gqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQVOHRB2NaOSTz56lItyD3Gaud7OIKIyR7-U0QkbQo8QA&oe=6AFF1E9B"}, "display_name": "The Spatial App", "keywords": ["Productivity", "Cinema", "Spatial", "Computing"], "long_description": "Turning your Meta Quest into a spatial computer by letting you place your web apps all around your space. You have an infinite canvas to browse, work, relax, or watch a movie.\n\u200e\n# **Infinite canvas**\n\nBrowse from our vast library of apps and place them wherever you want. You can also make your own custom app and use them as well.\n{1619285508954396}\n\n\n\u200e \n# **Cinema mode**\n\nOur immersive ambient lighting makes revisiting your favorite movies even more special.\n\nWe support Disney+, MAX, Apple TV+, Prime Video, Plex, Youtube, and other services like Hulu or Paramount+ as custom apps made by you.\n{1168371881663725}\n*Netflix is not supported on third party Meta Quest browsers, including The Spatial App\n\n\u200e \n# **Productivity**\n\nCast your computer to a large virtual monitor. Place our Widgets like a timer, sticky note, calculator, or a simple clock next to it for full productivity.\n{575417312208587}\n\n\n\u200e \n# **Environments**\n\nCancel out distractions with our stunning environments. Go to the Stratosphere, Deep space, or chill in an ambient void.\n{1148492843725258}\n\n\n\u200e \n# **Polished UI**\n\nWe have the best look and feel among all third party browsers on the Meta Quest store.\n{1183342316489244}\n\n\n\u200e \n# **Intuitive UX**\n\nYou can use The Spatial App with either controller or your hands, form up close, or from a far. You can turn off tracking when interacting with the real world.\n{683133417383739}", "short_description": "Turning your Meta Quest into a spatial computer by letting you place your web apps all around your space. You have an infinite canvas to browse, work, relax, or watch a movie.\n\nSome of our most loved features include Multitasking, Immersive cinema mode, Widgets... and our attention to detail unlike any other VR browser."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thespatial.app/privacy-policy", "developer_te